[{"op":"set","variable":30001,"value":1920},{"op":"set","variable":30002,"value":1080},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":2,"image":"i743"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i513"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"第二天，我们一大早来到了食堂。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白羽父亲的烤饭菜谱上，还差一样材料没有弄到。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"所谓的“野猪王”……"},{"op":"clear","layer":2},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i15"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12292"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“上面写着的是‘候鸟挚爱的猛兽之死肉’。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“候鸟好可怕！它们尽喜欢些什么啊！虽然好像鸟确实会去啄肉！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过不管怎样，最后一种食材肯定是肉没错了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“可到底是什么肉呢？猛兽？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12295"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“上面写着是野猪王。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我也知道，菜谱上是那么写着的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……可这个岛上真的有什么野猪王吗？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“我的记忆中似乎有个声音在喊着‘只要有精神什么都能做到’。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12298"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“哒―！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“!؟”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12295"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“唉嘿嘿。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“你很喜欢野猪王吗？”"},{"op":"set","variable":26027,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“嗯。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“哒―！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12298"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“哒―！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“不过，这岛上应该不会有野猪王吧？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12295"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“野猪王就是野猪的大王哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“哎？真的就是说野猪啊……野猪王。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12292"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“野猪的大王啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“不对不对，那也很不对劲啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“那种东西能抓得到吗؟؟”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“你爸爸好厉害啊。”"},{"op":"set","variable":26027,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“不啊，准备材料的不是爸爸。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“啊，那就是你外公吧？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"如果是那个人，感觉应该能搞得定。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12295"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“不是，是妈妈。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“哎؟؟”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"是白羽的妈妈搞定野猪王؟؟"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白羽之前确实说过，是她妈妈负责准备材料。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"可连野猪也是吗？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“你妈妈，到底是个怎样的人啊？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12298"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“充满干劲。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"充满干劲吗？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"镜子小姐也是这么说的。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12295"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“毕竟，是那个老爷子的女儿啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那就说得通了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“不过，野猪的大王到底是什么样的啊？”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我们再次走向了山里。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽然说是要去抓野猪，我们却是空着手。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"毕竟不可能那么轻易就遇到啊。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i40"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"野猪","text":"“咕噜噜噜噜！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“大王出现了！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“那个夸张的王冠是什么情况？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“为什么野猪会戴着那种东西？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"野猪","text":"“咕噜噜噜！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“白羽，你快退后。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“这里交给我。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“好了，放马过来吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"野猪","text":"“咕噜噜噜噜。”"},{"op":"image","layer":515,"image":"i18121"},{"op":"clear","layer":515},{"op":"clear","layer":768},{"op":"clear","layer":1024},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“咕啊！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"野猪王一头把我顶飞，然后直接跑掉了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“……下次我不会输的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12322"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“七海。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“怎么了？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12304"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“那个，还是我来弄吧？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“哎？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12292"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“野猪王。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“不不不。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“很危险的！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12314"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“没关系的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12295"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“我以前也有替妈妈去弄过。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“你说什么!؟”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"该不会，白羽身上蕴藏着十分强大的力量吧？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“白羽，咱们来掰手腕吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12304"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“哎？为什么？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“我来测试你一下。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12322"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“为什么突然要做这种事？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“来吧，把手伸出来。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12337"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“不要，感觉好可怕。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“来吧！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“呜呜，好吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12301"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“嘿！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“赢了！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12347"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“呜呜。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12351"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“为什么要欺负我……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“呃，不、不是的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“我只是测试一下你有没有和野猪王战斗的能力。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12322"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“你在说什么？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12292"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“走吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“去哪里？”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i37"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我跟在白羽身后，又回到了这个地方。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后来到了离道路有点距离的民家。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12298"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽·七海","text":"“打扰了～”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12295"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……一位老爷爷从房子里探出头来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"老爷爷看到白羽有些惊讶。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"强壮的老爷爷","text":"“白羽……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"强壮的老爷爷","text":"“好久不见了啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12339"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“那个，我来帮忙了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"强壮的老爷爷","text":"“啊，是吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"强壮的老爷爷","text":"“那么，能拜托你打扫一下那间小屋吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12295"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“嗯。七海也来帮忙。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“啊，嗯。”"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i363"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我们走向一间偏屋。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“好臭啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这里臭味也很大，而且和白羽家的鸡棚是不一样的臭味。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这是饲养什么的小屋呢？"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i12294"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“是养野猪的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“哎!؟”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i12294"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“现在它好像出去了，快点来打扫吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“啊，嗯。”"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i37"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……一个小时之后，打扫完小屋的我们回来了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"强壮的老爷爷","text":"“给，收下吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12295"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“非常感谢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我们拿到了野猪肉。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“那个，这是什么情况？这就是野猪王吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12298"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“不是哦。野猪王是泽田老爷子。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12295"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“唔，泽田老爷子就是刚才的那个人吧？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"强壮的老爷爷","text":"“因为我是养野猪的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"强壮的老爷爷","text":"“在冈山举办的野猪品评会上，我还得过金奖。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"强壮的老爷爷","text":"“所以，大家就都叫我野猪之王了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“然后，就简称就是野猪王？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"强壮的老爷爷","text":"“顺带一提，我还有白虎这个称号。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"又是称号……"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i15"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“这样应该就齐了吧？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我看着摆在食堂柜台上面，我们收集回来的各种材料。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12295"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“嗯！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“我都没帮上什么忙啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12292"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“我最初和妈妈一起准备材料的时候，也只是一直跟在她后面的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“你经常和妈妈一起去收集材料吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12298"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“嗯。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"哦……原来是这么回事。"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i420"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我这才察觉到。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白羽妈妈留下的笔记。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"笔记上写得那么夸张，想必是为了陪白羽一起玩才那么写的吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"为了让收集材料的过程更加有趣，才把菜谱写得这么奇怪。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过……野猪这个实在有点……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白羽的妈妈啊……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"从菜谱的内容就能看出是个很欢乐的人。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"为了能在繁忙之中让白羽快乐地度过夏天，费了不少心思。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"可既然这样，为什么……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在父亲刚刚去世，白羽最伤心痛苦的时候，她却不知去向了呢？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她到底去了哪里？"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i507"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"爸爸、妈妈……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我是不是也有父母……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在为我久出不归而担心呢？"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i15"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我开始用准备齐全的材料做烤饭。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白羽说她爸爸做的，和我做的似乎在调味上相差无几。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那么我只要按照原有的流程，把材料换成我们收集的这些，说不定做出来的味道就能跟她爸爸做的差不多。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我打开了煤气。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"身体果然自然而然就动了起来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"就好像做烤饭对我来说就是理所当然的事情一样。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我在丧失记忆之前……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"做过很多烤饭……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不对，应该是做过很多炒饭吧？"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i15"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12298"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽·七海","text":"“完成～”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“看上去好像很好吃啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12295"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“嗯！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“那就赶快尝尝吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12304"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“可以吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“因为我也辨别不出做得到底是不是那个味道啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12295"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……嗯。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“怎么样？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12304"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“这个……好好吃！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12298"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“而且……和爸爸的烤饭很像。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“那么……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12356"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12337"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“对不起。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“嗯？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“还是不一样。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12331"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“虽然已经非常接近了……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“还缺了什么吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12337"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……嗯。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"唔……果然就算材料相同，也无法完全还原味道啊。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“我再做一次试试？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12292"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“不用了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12322"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“我觉得不是调味的问题，是还缺了什么材料。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"缺了材料……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"菜谱上写的材料已经全都凑齐了啊。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“你能吃出具体有什么差别吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12331"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“嗯，这个……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12356"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“还要更甜一点。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“甜؟؟”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我应该已经是完全照着菜谱做的了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"是材料放的分量有些差别吗？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"可白羽说是缺少材料。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“对了，菜谱最后……画了一个标志。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12304"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“发电厂的标志？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“发电厂？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12292"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“嗯，在课上学到的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“应、应该不是吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“为什么你妈妈要在菜谱上画发电厂的标志啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"参照白羽妈妈的做法，这应该……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“这是太阳吧！说不定就是最后一样材料。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12304"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“材料是太阳？什么意思啊？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“我本来以为只是随便画着玩的，不过这太不自然了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“如果只是画着玩的，应该会画在菜谱最上面才对。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“没有必要画在最下面。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12322"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“原、原来如此？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“这只是最初步的推理。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12304"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“那，这个太阳……？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“嗯，这才是最后一样材料。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12322"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“但这是什么意思呢？要怎么把太阳加进去？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“……这就不太清楚了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“不过总之，肯定是什么甜的东西。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12304"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“要试试多放些糖吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“唔，糖和太阳，从语感上看好像也不是完全没关系。”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"重新做烤饭的时候，我放了些糖。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"味道肯定是变甜了。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i15"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"外观看起来没什么变化。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我试着吃了一口。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“感觉不太搭啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"应该不是这个。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“白羽，你应该有亲眼看爸爸做过吧？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12295"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“嗯。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“你还有什么印象吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12304"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12322"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“我记得，爸爸好像有放过一种黑黑碎碎的东西。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12292"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“又黑又碎，而且还有甜味？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“芝麻之类的？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“但是没有放芝麻啊，没有芝麻的味道。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“黑色的碎末，不是芝麻，还有甜味。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“加点巧克力试试？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12295"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“我也觉得是巧克力。”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"于是，我试着在炒的时候加了些巧克力。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"食堂里飘起了一阵甜香和焦香。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i15"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我尝了一下焦糖色的烤饭。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“感觉还挺搭的，真是意外。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12292"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“嗯，很好吃，不过……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12322"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“不是吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12301"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“嗯。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"也、也对啊。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"毕竟巧克力和太阳也没什么关联。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12292"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“太阳啊……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我用勺子对着窗外的太阳舀了一勺。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"当然了，什么都舀不到。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“对了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“可能我们想太多了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12322"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“嗯？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“就是太阳本身啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12304"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“太阳……本身？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“嗯，应该这样，把炒饭放到这里。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我把炒饭放到了窗外的太阳能够充分照到的位置。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12292"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“然后呢？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“就这样，让它好好地享受一下日光浴。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12322"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“日光浴……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12304"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“那样就会变甜吗？为什么？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“是啊，为什么呢？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“随着太阳光的照射，让各种食材发酵。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12301"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“要腐烂才行吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“确实会腐烂啊……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“不过在那之前应该会变甜。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12304"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“会吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“你想，不是有人说，蔬菜有太阳公公的照顾就会变甜吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12322"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“好像是有人说过。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“没错，就是这样。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12295"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“就是这样吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“总之，咱们先等一会儿吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12298"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“噢～”"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i15"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一个小时之后"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"被太阳晒过的炒饭……"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12322"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“稍微有点干了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“确、确实呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我们尝了一下。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12301"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“不对。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“确实不对……其实我中途就觉得不太对了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“我也是。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“一直坐在这想也不是办法。”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":2,"image":"i740"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i513"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“咱们还是出去找太阳吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i12297"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“噢～”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过，话说回来……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"太阳一直都能见到，也没什么好找的……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而且毫无头绪，也没法去找。"},{"op":"clear","layer":2},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i37"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"去离太阳最近的地方吗？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"也就是说，去爬最高的山……？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"可是以白羽的体力不可能爬得上去。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……啊，对了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“你还记不记得你妈妈都带你去过什么地方？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12322"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“这个……我想想……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12304"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“怎么了？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12322"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“有那么个地方。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12314"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“但是那里没有太阳啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“是个什么样的地方？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12322"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“一个盛开着很多花的地方。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“花？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12292"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“很大的花。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“咱们去那里看看吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12304"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……哎？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“你不知道那个地方在哪吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12311"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“不是……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咦……？白羽看上去好像在犹豫……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"难道是她不想去的地方吗？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过她很快就摇了摇头，看着我说道。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12292"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“嗯，可以。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“咱们走吧。”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1501"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这里是……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"向日葵田？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“对啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这不就是太阳吗？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"黑色，细碎的……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"还有点甜。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1500"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“我明白了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“是葵花籽啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“葵花籽？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“一定是把这个弄碎炒在饭里的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“葵花籽，很甜吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“来，你尝尝看。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我摘出了一粒葵花籽，递到了白羽的手中。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“啊，嗯……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“稍微有点甜。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1502"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“好漂亮啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1503"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“嗯。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……呜。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“嗯？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白羽小小的肩膀微微颤抖着。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“我是第一次来。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“哎？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“自从妈妈她不见了以后……我第一次来这里。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“那个。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“其实。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“其实我……”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1505"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……好想回去。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“回到一年前。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“真的好想回去。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“因为，他们那时都在。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“妈妈，在这里……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“让我骑脖子。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“回店里以后，爸爸给我们做饭。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“我们三个人一起吃饭。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“真的很温暖。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“但是。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1504"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“不在了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“今年，他们都不在了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“呜、呜……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“呜啊啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“啊啊啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“呜呜呜呜呜……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"此时，我才稍稍有些明白。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"为什么老爷子说不能带白羽去食堂。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"同时，也明白了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"为什么跟白羽说要来这里的时候她会犹豫。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"因为，这会让她回想起过去那些快乐的记忆……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那些日子已经一去不复返了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这里，已经再也见不到白羽所期盼的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"爸爸，和妈妈。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一家三口幸福的夏天，已经再也回不来了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"来到这里以后，她就再也无法不去正视这个现实。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不知为何。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“呜……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我也快要哭出来了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“……呃。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"仿佛，我也曾经有着类似的回忆。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"曾经和谁一起……仰望着巨大的花朵。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我想要去回忆。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"却怎么也回想不起来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“呜，啊……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"可是又非常怀念……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"无比怀念。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"同时，我心中开始后悔，不应该让白羽也有这样悲伤的心情。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"所以，我希望至少当我在身边的时候……可以让她露出笑容。"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"set","variable":23,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":19,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":20,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":21,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":0},{"op":"return"},{"op":"end"}]